# Material dos jogos fornecido pelo usuario: NUNCA versionar.
# Game material supplied by the user: NEVER commit it.
# ROMs, BIOS, C gerado a partir das ROMs, tiles/sprites extraidos, dumps de RAM,
# traces com dados do jogo e save states ficam em private/.
private/

# Segunda barreira: ROMs, BIOS e arquivos de chip MVS em qualquer lugar do repo.
# Second barrier: ROMs, BIOS and MVS chip files anywhere in the repo.
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.bin
*.rom
*.neo
*.chd
*.p[0-9]
*.p[0-9][0-9]
*.c[0-9]
*.c[0-9][0-9]
*.m[0-9]
*.s[0-9]
*.v[0-9]
*.v[0-9][0-9]
*.sp1
*.sp2

# Save states, NVRAM, dumps de memoria e traces de emuladores.
# Save states, NVRAM, memory dumps and emulator traces.
*.sta
*.state
*.fs
*.mst
*.nv
*.nvram
*.dmp
*.trace
*.inp

# Build e lixo de sistema / Build output and OS junk
build/
out/
target/
*.log
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
